# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Narrow, explicit exceptions: exactly the named synthetic test fixtures, never
# a wildcard. A wildcard negation (e.g. `!tests/fixtures/*.png`) would also
# un-ignore a real restricted file if one were ever mistakenly saved into this
# folder (e.g. during Phase 6 calibration work, which reads the real reference
# PNGs) - naming each committable fixture exactly closes that gap. Verified
# with `git check-ignore -v` / `git add` dry-run before each fixture is
# committed, not assumed (see docs/progress.md §1).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!tests/fixtures/
!tests/fixtures/synth_tiny.mp4
!tests/fixtures/synth_db.xlsx
!tests/fixtures/legend_swatches.png
